PHASE 2 — ENGINE REFACTOR (lms-frontend/assets/js/analytics.engine.js)
Split into (1) PURE functions with no DB access and exported for testing, and (2) thin DB wrappers.
Pure: weightedScore(parts) (75/15/10 with proportional redistribution, rounded to 2 decimals), ratingForScore(score) (bands above), subjectScores(components) -> {academicPct, attendancePct, modulePct} (null when denominator 0), overallScore(subjectsComponents) per D2, betaPosterior(mySuccesses, myFailures, peerSuccesses, peerFailures, priorStrength=4), betaCredibleInterval(alpha, beta, level=0.90) using exact quantiles of the Beta distribution, probBetaAbove(alpha, beta, x) = P(theta > x), regularizedIncompleteBeta(x, a, b) (continued fraction, no external libraries), transmute(initialGrade) (D3).
